[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849341765","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106075#issuecomment-2849341765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106075","id":2849341765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p1YFF","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-04T18:02:33Z","updated_at":"2025-05-04T18:03:36Z","body":"So GCC *specifically* does not like the use of inlined pragmas; clang & MSVC have no issues with it, but I gotta tweak the code to accomodate this. This changes the formatting from this:\r\n```cpp\r\n\tif (GODOT_DEPRECATED_BEGIN unlikely(m_param == nullptr) GODOT_DEPRECATED_END) { \\\r\n```\r\nto this:\r\n```cpp\r\n\tGODOT_DEPRECATED_BEGIN              \\\r\n\tif (unlikely(m_param == nullptr)) { \\\r\n\t\tGODOT_DEPRECATED_END        \\\r\n```\r\nNot a dealbreaker, but definitely uglier","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849341765/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"h